00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:42.420
two with sales up 11%, co-operating margin approaching 40%.

00:00:42.420 --> 00:00:47.660
We see strong commercial execution, which I think demonstrates our ability to drive

00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:54.000
